From ae723e60b6a7f25741e1799c06613f3404426848 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 20:22:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] nemesis: on-device transcription (Whisper via
 transformers.js) + graph zoom polish

- recorder/transcribe.ts: whisper-tiny.en ASR pipeline (single-thread WASM,
  hub model fetch), webm->16kHz-mono decode via OfflineAudioContext.
- Recorder UI: Transcribe button per recording w/ progress, transcript panel,
  Save-as-note into the Library vault.
- vite: optimizeDeps.exclude transformers.js (self-loads WASM); ort-wasm bundles
  locally so the engine needs no CDN. dep: @huggingface/transformers.
- graph: smaller nodes + generous zoomToFit padding (less zoomed-in).
